":\"p0bw6yhh\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-20T10:39:53.000Z\",\"techniqueUrl\":\"/food/how_to_cook/watch/folding\",\"title\":\"Folding\"},{\"description\":\"Learn how to whip cream by following this simple video from BBC Food.\",\"duration\":\"PT57S\",\"holdingImageUrl\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/640xn/p07f404k.jpg\",\"id\":\"p07f3zt2\",\"updatedAt\":\"2025-01-20T17:29:09.000Z\",\"techniqueUrl\":\"/food/how_to_cook/watch/whipping_cream\",\"title\":\"How to whip cream\"}],\"relatedRecipes\":{\"fromEpisode\":{},\"menu\":[{\"sequence\":1,\"id\":\"potatosoup_11631\",\"title\":\"Potato soup\",\"prepTime\":\"less than 30 mins\",\"cookingTime\":\"10 to 30 mins\",\"hasImage\":\"true\",\"description\":\"A comforting classic, this easy potato soup uses a handful of store cupboard ingredients to great effect. \\r\\n\\r\\nFor this recipe you will need a blender or food processor.\\r\\n\\r\\nEach serving provides 152 kcal, 2.5g protein, 15.3g carbohydrate (of which 2.8g sugars), 8.6g fat (of which 5.3g saturates), 1.8g fibre and 0.68g salt.\\r\\n\",\"chef\":{\"displayName\":\"Darina Allen\",\"id\":\"darina_allen\"},\"course\":{\"id\":\"starters_and_nibbles\",\"title\":\"Starters & nibbles\"},\"type\":\"collection\",\"url\":\"/food/recipes/potatosoup_11631\",\"image\":{\"template\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_{width}/recipes/potatosoup_11631_16x9.jpg\",\"aceTemplate\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/{width}/food/recipes/potatosoup_11631_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/potatosoup_11631_16x9.jpg\",\"aceThumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/1600/food/recipes/potatosoup_11631_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"sizes\":[160,208,320,448,608,832,1600]},\"relations\":{\"count\":4,\"title\":\"Vegetarian St Patrick's Day menu recipes\",\"path\":\"/food/menus/vegetarian_st_patricks_day_menu\"}},{\"sequence\":2,\"id\":\"vegetariancottagepie_92035\",\"title\":\"Vegetarian cottage pie\",\"prepTime\":\"less than 30 mins\",\"cookingTime\":\"30 mins to 1 hour\",\"hasImage\":\"true\",\"description\":\"A vegetarian take on a classic cottage pie. Beans and veggie mince replace meat, and root vegetables give the mash a unique twist. \",\"chef\":{\"displayName\":\"Gordon Jones\",\"id\":\"gordon_jones\"},\"course\":{\"id\":\"main_course\",\"title\":\"Main course\"},\"type\":\"collection\",\"url\":\"/food/recipes/vegetariancottagepie_92035\",\"image\":{\"template\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_{width}/recipes/vegetariancottagepie_92035_16x9.jpg\",\"aceTemplate\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/{width}/food/recipes/vegetariancottagepie_92035_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/vegetariancottagepie_92035_16x9.jpg\",\"aceThumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/1600/food/recipes/vegetariancottagepie_92035_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"sizes\":[160,208,320,448,608,832,1600]},\"relations\":{\"count\":4,\"title\":\"Vegetarian St Patrick's Day menu recipes\",\"path\":\"/food/menus/vegetarian_st_patricks_day_menu\"}},{\"sequence\":3,\"id\":\"irishsodabread_67445\",\"title\":\"Easy Irish soda bread\",\"prepTime\":\"less than 30 mins\",\"cookingTime\":\"10 to 30 mins\",\"hasImage\":\"true\",\"description\":\"Try this easy soda bread recipe for when you want bread in a hurry – it's ready in less than an hour with no kneading, proving (or yeast). This makes a small loaf, but you can easily double the recipe and make two.\\r\\n\\r\\nEach serving provides 215kcal, 8g protein, 43g carbohydrate (of which 3g sugars), 1g fat (of which 0.3g saturates), 1g fibre and 1g salt.\",\"chef\":{\"displayName\":\"James Martin\",\"id\":\"james_martin\"},\"course\":{\"id\":\"afternoon_tea\",\"title\":\"Cakes and baking\"},\"type\":\"collection\",\"url\":\"/food/recipes/irishsodabread_67445\",\"image\":{\"template\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_{width}/recipes/irishsodabread_67445_16x9.jpg\",\"aceTemplate\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/{width}/food/recipes/irishsodabread_67445_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/irishsodabread_67445_16x9.jpg\",\"aceThumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/1600/food/recipes/irishsodabread_67445_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"sizes\":[160,208,320,448,608,832,1600]},\"relations\":{\"count\":4,\"title\":\"Vegetarian St Patrick's Day menu recipes\",\"path\":\"/food/menus/vegetarian_st_patricks_day_menu\"}}],\"collection\":[{\"sequence\":1,\"id\":\"easy_no-cook_cheesecake_89811\",\"title\":\"Easy no bake cheesecake\",\"prepTime\":\"over 2 hours\",\"cookingTime\":\"less than 10 mins\",\"hasImage\":\"true\",\"description\":\"When you just don't have the energy to mess about with baking, an easy cheesecake is a make-ahead wonder. You can swap in all kinds of toppings for this cheesecake – fresh berries, chocolate biscuits, a shop-bought fruit compôte, or other chopped up chocolate bars. Alternatively, spread the top lightly with lemon curd and sprinkle with crushed meringues.\",\"chef\":{\"displayName\":\"Emily Angle\",\"id\":\"emily_angle\"},\"course\":{\"id\":\"desserts\",\"title\":\"Desserts\"},\"type\":\"collection\",\"url\":\"/food/recipes/easy_no-cook_cheesecake_89811\",\"image\":{\"template\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_{width}/recipes/easy_no-cook_cheesecake_89811_16x9.jpg\",\"aceTemplate\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/{width}/food/recipes/easy_no-cook_cheesecake_89811_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/easy_no-cook_cheesecake_89811_16x9.jpg\",\"aceThumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/1600/food/recipes/easy_no-cook_cheesecake_89811_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"sizes\":[160,208,320,448,608,832,1600]},\"relations\":{\"count\":34,\"title\":\"Our best cheesecake recipes\",\"path\":\"/food/collections/1_our_best_cheesecake_recipes\"}}],\"ingredient\":[{\"id\":\"baked_welsh_cake_68115\",\"title\":\"Baked Welsh cake cheese