. \\r\\n\\r\\nFor this recipe, you will need two 23cm/9in metal pie tins.\",\"availabilityEnd\":\"2024-05-25T00:00:00.000Z\",\"diets\":[{\"id\":\"egg_free\"},{\"id\":\"nut_free\"}],\"isQuickAndEasy\":\"false\",\"chef\":{\"id\":\"samin_nosrat\",\"hasImage\":\"false\",\"displayName\":\"Samin Nosrat\"},\"relations\":{\"count\":77,\"title\":\"cheesecake recipes\",\"path\":\"/food/cheesecake\"},\"type\":\"dish\",\"url\":\"/food/recipes/mango_pie_18053\",\"image\":{\"template\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_{width}/recipes/mango_pie_18053_16x9.jpg\",\"aceTemplate\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/{width}/food/recipes/mango_pie_18053_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/mango_pie_18053_16x9.jpg\",\"aceThumbnail\":\"https://ichef.bbc.co.uk/ace/standard/1600/food/recipes/mango_pie_18053_16x9.jpg.webp\",\"sizes\":[160,208,320,448,608,832,1600]}}]}}}]}]}]},{\"name\":\"after\",\"additionalProperties\":{},\"landmarks\":[]},{\"name\":\"bottom\",\"additionalProperties\":{},\"landmarks\":[{\"element\":\"footer\",\"containers\":[{\"name\":\"static-links\",\"importance\":\"PRIMARY\",\"hasFetcher\":true,\"props\":[{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"urn\",\"value\":\"urn:bbc:tipo:list:035d1944-57bd-494e-a37f-f33260e46601\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"lazyLoadImages\",\"value\":true}]},{\"name\":\"link-list\",\"importance\":\"PRIMARY\",\"layout\":{\"name\":\"Wrap\"},\"hasFetcher\":true,\"fetchParams\":[{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"dataType\",\"value\":\"foodArticles\"}],\"props\":[]},{\"name\":\"message-banner\",\"importance\":\"SECONDARY\",\"hasFetcher\":false,\"props\":[{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"title\",\"value\":\"Summer Recipes\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"subTitle\",\"value\":\"Step into summer with this collection of delicious recipes\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"linkText\",\"value\":\"Explore the collection\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"linkUrl\",\"value\":\"/food/occasions/summer_dinner_recipes\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"backgroundImage\",\"value\":{\"url\":\"https://food-images.files.bbci.co.uk/food/timed_promos/summer.jpg\"}},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"fontColour\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"lazyLoadImages\",\"value\":true},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"backgroundColour\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"tracking\",\"value\":{\"groupType\":\"message banner\"}}]},{\"name\":\"global-footer\",\"importance\":\"PRIMARY\",\"hasFetcher\":true,\"props\":[],\"fetchParams\":[{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"country\",\"value\":\"us\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"language\",\"value\":\"en-GB\"},{\"__typename\":\"RouteParam\",\"name\":\"service\",\"lookup\":\"service\"},{\"__typename\":\"LiteralProp\",\"name\":\"service\",\"value\":\"food\"},{\"__typename\":\"StoreReader\",\"name\":\"variant\",\"store\":\"global-navigation\",\"lookup\":\"variant\"}]}]}]}]},\"headers\":{\"vary\":\"mvt-test_food_aa_signin_modal\"}},\"featureToggles\":{},\"experimentation\":{\"registeredExperiments\":[\"test_food_aa_signin_modal\"],\"experiments\":{},\"experimentActivations\":[]},\"path\":\"/food/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293\"},\"stores\":{\"analytics\":{\"page\":{\"contentId\":\"urn:bbc:food:recipe:baileysandchocolatec_72293\",\"name\":\"\",\"destination\":\"FOOD\",\"producer\":\"BBC_FOOD\",\"section\":\"Recipes\",\"contentType\":\"recipe\",\"language\":\"en-GB\",\"additionalProperties\":{\"publication_date\":\"2010-10-28T00:00:00.000Z\",\"updated_date\":\"2025-11-12T17:03:49.000Z\"}}},\"userLocationData\":{\"userLocationData\":{}},\"bbcAccountSignInPromptCustomisation\":{\"options\":{\"title\":{\"en-GB\":\"One account connects all of the BBC\"},\"subTitle\":{\"en-GB\":\"Sign in is quick and easy\"},\"experimentation\":{\"experimentId\":\"test_food_aa_signin_modal\"}}},\"metadata\":{\"metadata\":{\"title\":\"Irish cream and chocolate cheesecake recipe - BBC Food\",\"description\":\"The smooth, creamy Irish cream liqueur gives this no-bake cheesecake the wow factor. Top with grated chocolate and a dusting of cocoa.\",\"image\":{\"src\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293_16x9.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Irish cream and chocolate cheesecake\"},\"openGraph\":{\"og:description\":\"The smooth, creamy Irish cream liqueur gives this no-bake cheesecake the wow factor. Top with grated chocolate and a dusting of cocoa.\",\"og:image\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_448/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293_16x9.jpg\",\"og:image:secure_url\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_448/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293_16x9.jpg\",\"og:image:width\":\"448\",\"og:image:height\":\"224\",\"og:locale\":\"en-GB\",\"og:title\":\"Irish cream and chocolate cheesecake recipe\",\"og:site_name\":\"BBC Food\",\"og:type\":\"article\",\"og:image:type\":\"image/jpeg\",\"og:image:alt\":\"Irish cream and chocolate cheesecake recipe\",\"og:url\":\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293\"},\"twitterCard\":{\"twitter:card\":\"summary_large_image\",\"twitter:description\":\"The smooth, creamy Irish cream liqueur gives this no-bake cheesecake the wow factor. Top with grated chocolate and a dusting of cocoa.\",\"twitter:domain\":\"www.bbc.co.uk\",\"twitter:image:src\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_448/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293_16x9.jpg\",\"twitter:site\":\"@BBCFood\",\"twitter:title\":\"Irish cream and chocolate cheesecake recipe\",\"twitter:image\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_448/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293_16x9.jpg\"},\"schemaOrg\":{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Recipe\",\"description\":\"Use a smooth, creamy Irish liqueur, like Baileys, to give this no-bake cheesecake the wow factor. Top with grated chocolate or a dusting of cocoa. It's a fab make-ahead Christmas dessert that's easy to  put together and always impresses.\",\"headline\":\"Irish cream and chocolate cheesecake\",\"image\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"width\":1600,\"height\":900,\"url\":\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/food/ic/food_16x9_1600/recipes/baileysandchocolatec_72293_16x9.jpg\"},\"name\":\"Irish cream and chocolate cheesecake\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Rob Burns\"},\"datePublished\":\"2010-10-28T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-11-12T17:03:49.000Z\",\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"BBC\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/core/website/assets/static/webcore/bbc_blocks_84x24.5b565ac136ea8f9cb3b0f8e02eca1e0f.svg\",\"width\":84,\"height\":24}},\"aggregateRating\":{\"@type\":\"AggregateRating\",\"ratingCount\":128,\"ratingValue\":4.3671875},\"prepTime\":\"PT2H\",\"cookTime\":\"PT10M\",\"keywords\":\"our best cheesecake, alternative christmas cake, boozy puddings, christmas baking, christmas cheesecake, christmas chocolate, easy christmas dessert ideas, decadent dessert, eurovision party ideas, father's day cakes and bakes, festive puds, irresistible irish food, luxury christmas desserts, no-bake cheesecakes, no-cook christmas, no-cook christmas desserts, vegetarian st patrick's day menu, birthday party, christmas, dinner party, mother's day, st patrick's day, cheesecake, cream cheese, egg free, vegetarian\",\"recipeCategory\":\"Desserts\",\"recipeCuisine\":\"Irish\",\"recipeIngredient\":[\"100g/3½oz butter, plus extra for greasing\",\"250g/8¾oz digestive biscuits, crushed\",\"600g/1lb 5oz full-fat cream cheese\",\"25ml/1fl oz Irish cream liqueur, such as Baileys\",\"100ml/3½oz icing sugar\",\"300ml/10½oz double cream, whipped\",\"100g/3½oz grated chocolate (dark or milk chocolate)\",\"200ml/7¼oz double cream, whipped (optional)\",\"cocoa powder or more grated chocolate\"],\"recipeInstructions\":[\"Line the base of a 18cm/7in springform tin with baking paper and lightly grease the sides with melted butter.\",\"Melt the butter in a saucepan and add the crushed digestive biscuits. Mix well until the biscuits have absorbed all the butter. \",\"Press the biscuit mixture into the bottom of the prepared tin in an even layer. Put in the fridge for 1 hour or until the base is firm and set.  \",\"Meanwhile, prepare the filling. Lightly whip the cream cheese then beat in the Irish cream and icing sugar. Fold in the whipped cream and grated chocolate. When smooth, spoon evenly on top of the biscuit base. \",\"Return to the fridge for a further 2 hours, or until the filling is set. \",\"Once set, remove from the tin and decorate with whipped cream (if using) and cocoa powder or grated chocolate dusted over the top. \"],\"recipeYield\":\"Serves 6 (makes a 18cm/7in cheesecake)\",\"suitableForDiet\":[\"http://schema.org/VegetarianDiet\"]},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"url\":\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/food\",\"potentialAction\":{\"@type\":\"SearchAction\",\"target\":\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/food/search?q={query}\",\"query-input\":\"required name=query\"}},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"description\":\"A fool-proof way to fold in flour, keeping your bakes light and airy.\",\"duration\":\"PT35S\",\"name\":\"Folding\",\"thumbnailUrl\":[\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/640xn/p0bw72v0.jpg\"],\"uploadDate\":\"2025-01-20T10:39:53.000Z\"},{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"VideoObject\",\"description\":\"Learn how to whip cream by following this simple video from BBC Food.\",\"duration\":\"PT57S\",\"name\":\"How to whip cream\",\"thumbnailUrl\":[\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/640xn/p07f404k.jpg\"],\"uploadDate\":\"2025-01-20T17:29:09.000Z\"}]}}},\"bbcAccount\":{\"signInPrompt\":{\"show\":false,\"userOrigin\":null,\"ptrt\":null},\"pageType\":\"content\",\"service\":\"food\"}},\"route\":\"/food/recipes/:id\"}";